# Force LF line endings for every text file, regardless of core.autocrlf on
# whatever machine/agent checks this repo out - this repo's own
# core.autocrlf=true (a Windows-friendly git default) was converting LF to
# CRLF in the working tree on every checkout/stash/pull, which gofmt (LF-only)
# then correctly flagged as "unformatted" even though the actual Go code was
# fine - pure line-ending noise that repeatedly confused agents working in
# this repo into thinking there was a real formatting problem to fix.
* text=auto eol=lf
